WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:04,210
Brother Chuan, let’s just be like before

2
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:05,610
No one will stop us

3
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:14,450
My friend Ji Chuan has been missing for several days.

4
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:18,560
Help me find him and I will join your base

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:23,270
Just one person, is it worth risking so many people?

6
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:25,100
This is my condition for joining

7
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,100
No one can force me to do anything

8
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,700
If you find him dead when you get there

9
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,700
to return immediately

10
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,500
Hu Xun, this task will be handed over to your second team.

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,500
Protect Figure 1 and rescue his friend

12
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,500
If the target is not found at the destination

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,500
Return after confirming that there is no danger
